WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.204
Open your link and sign in
with an email code, or with
LinkedIn.

2
00:00:05.034 --> 00:00:06.716
Tell us your batch and
branch.

3
00:00:06.716 --> 00:00:09.975
Paste your LinkedIn text, or
just tap "Fill my profile".

4
00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:14.079
To join the Grand Reunion,
tap Register.

5
00:00:14.079 --> 00:00:19.152
Choose your ticket, add
family, and tick the optional
27 Dec tour.

6
00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:23.037
Then pay by UPI and enter the
12-digit reference.

7
00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:28.524
Your QR entry pass appears.
Show it at the gate. It even
works offline.

8
00:00:28.954 --> 00:00:32.863
To find batchmates, open
Menu, then Find JECians.

9
00:00:32.863 --> 00:00:36.733
Search by name, batch or
city, and tap to chat.

10
00:00:37.263 --> 00:00:40.127
Share photos and videos from
the event.

11
00:00:40.127 --> 00:00:44.727
Open Menu, Reunion photos &
videos, then Add photos &
videos.

12
00:00:45.157 --> 00:00:49.224
Post a story that lasts 24
hours, or see what's new on
Home.

13
00:00:49.654 --> 00:00:53.278
Finally, add the app to your
home screen for one-tap
access.

14
00:00:53.608 --> 00:00:57.272
JEC Alumni Connect. Your
batch, your college, one app.
